   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det tre&#xe5;riga st&#xf6;det till TESEV fokuserar p&#xe5; f&#xf6;ljande omr&#xe5;den          r&#xe4;ttsstatens principer och r&#xe4;ttsreform i Turkiet, konstitutionell     reform och demokratiserings samtal. TESEV som &#xe4;r en think-tank        arbetar fr&#xe4;mst med forskning projekt och p&#xe5;verkansarbetet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The threes year support to TESEV focus on the following areas; Rule   of Law and Judicial Reform in Turkey, Constitutional Reform and       Democratization talks. TESEV is a think tank and work mailny through  the publication of research and advocacy events.</narrative>
